<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo traffic up 14.5 pct Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo traffic up 14.5 pct Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total air cargo traffic handled at Munich airport in the first ten months of this year at 60,361 tonnes was 14.5 percent above the same period of last year, airpoort authority figures show.</p>
<p>Details of traffic in tonnes with percentage changes from year ago included:</p>
<p>	    Total	     Pct</p>
<p>	    Traffic	   change</p>
<p> Aug	46,760	    up 12.9</p>
<p> Sept     53,224	    up 13.0</p>
<p> Oct	60,361	    up 14.5</p>
<p>	    Exports   Change     Imports   Change</p>
<p> Aug	22,963    up 5.9     23,797    up 20.6</p>
<p> Sept     26,186    up 5.8     27,038    up 20.8</p>
<p> Oct	29,808    up 7.8     30,553    up 21.9</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH, traffic statistics dept. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel:+44 171 542 7706 Fax:+44 171 542 5017</p>
